<%- include("includes/header", { title: "Log in" }) %>

<section class="card narrow">
  <h1>Admin login</h1>
  <p>There is no password. To log in:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the Barchasi Arzon bot in Telegram.</li>
    <li>Press <b>⚙️ Admin panel</b> (or send <code>/admin</code>).</li>
    <li>Open the link the bot sends you. It works once, for 10 minutes.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="muted">Only Telegram accounts listed in <code>ADMIN_IDS</code> get the admin button.</p>
</section>

